  "answer_text": "It appears that **The Flash (CW series)** has officially ended. During the course of the series, 184 episodes of *The Flash* aired over nine seasons, between October 7, 2014, and **May 24, 2023**.\n\n*The Flash* Season 9 was the end of the road for the series, and it also ended the Arrowverse as a whole, as The CW had canceled the last few series that made up the shared DC TV universe before Season 9 premiered.\n\nThere are currently no TV airings of *The Flash* scheduled in the next 14 days. You can add *The Flash* to your watchlist to find out if it ever comes back.\n\nSo unfortunately, there are **no new episodes** of *The Flash* planned at this time. If you're a fan of the character, you might want to keep an eye out for any future DC projects featuring The Flash!",
